.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-GRAPH-IMPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-graph\-import \- Import another store file as a named graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu graph import\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIdb\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import another store file as a named graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
IRI under which to import the graph
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIdb\fR>

